      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140430_18130475_0148.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140430_18130475_0148&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140430_18130475_0148.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140430_18131350_0149.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140430_18131350_0149&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140430_18131350_0149.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: Frances Werk, To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Eureka, Illinois on July 31, 1911&lt;br&gt;
Postcard Info: No. D 6484 by F. B. Stumpf &amp;amp; Co., Druggists, Eureka, Ill.&lt;br&gt;
Picture Info: Eureka College Campus, Eureka, Ill. Photo only Copyrighted 1908 by F. B. Stumpf&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eureka, Ill.&lt;br&gt;
Dear Friend,&lt;br&gt;
I suppose you are enjoying yourself immensely. I am. Write when you have time.&lt;br&gt;
Frances Werk&lt;/p&gt;</description>
